hinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「所有的賞與罰皆自我出…」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Suǒyǒu de Shǎng yǔ Fá Jiē Zì Wǒ Chū...\"</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">「あらゆる褒賞と罰は</span> <span lang=\"ja\">この手によるもの…」</span><br /><small><i>\"Arayuru Houshou to Batsu wa Kono te ni Yoru Mono...\"</i></small></td><td>\"All Rewards and Punishments Will Be Given by This Hand...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">「모든</span> <span lang=\"ko\">상벌은</span> <span lang=\"ko\">내가</span> <span lang=\"ko\">내릴</span> <span lang=\"ko\">것이다…」</span><br /><small><i>\"Modeun Sangbeol-eun Naega Naeril Geosida...\"</i></small></td><td>\"I Will Bestow All Rewards and Punishments...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Yo otorgar<span lang=\"es\">é</span> toda recompensa y castigo</td><td>I Will Grant All Recompense and Punishment</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td><span lang=\"fr\">«</span>&#160;<span lang=\"fr\">À</span> moi d'accorder toute r<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>compense et toute punition...&#160;<span lang=\"fr\">»</span></td><td>\"All Reward and All Punishment, Mine to Bestow...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">«За</span> <span lang=\"ru\">добрые</span> <span lang=\"ru\">деяния</span> <span lang=\"ru\">и</span> <span lang=\"ru\">прегрешения</span> <span lang=\"ru\">воздам</span> <span lang=\"ru\">я</span>...<span lang=\"ru\">»</span><br /><small><i>\"Za dobryye deyaniya i pregresheniya vozdam ya...\"</i></small></td><td>\"For Good Deeds and Transgressions I Will Repay...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>\"All Rewards and Retribution, Mine to Bestow...<wbr />\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">\"Tất Cả Thưởng Và Phạt Do Ta Tự Ra...\"</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td><span lang=\"de\">„</span>Jede Belohnung und Vergeltung wird von mir vergeben ...<wbr /><span lang=\"de\"